{
    "title": "earnify",
    "description": "Earn loyalty reward points on every purchase, at the pump and in-store, with earnify\u2122! Newly registered users are eligible for a 250-point welcome offer that can be redeemed for exciting rewards! Please note that points might take up to 24 hours to appear. earnify\u2122 is available at participating bp, Amoco, and ampm sites.\u202f \r\n\r\nWith the earnify\u2122  app, you\u2019ll save on app only deals and get rewarded with incredible Bonus Deals on your favorite stuff. \r\n\r\nearnify\u2122 members can enjoy the following perks:\u202f\u202f \r\n    Welcome offer of 250 points + 2x points for first 90 days\u202f\u202f \r\n    Instant 5\u00a2 savings on every gallon\u202f \r\n    Earn 1 point per dollar spent on fuel\u202f \r\n    Earn 2 points per dollar spent on convenience\u202f \r\n    Redeem for rewards at the pump or on in-store purchases\u202f \r\n\r\nOther earnify\u2122 app features:\u202f \r\n    Easily register in just seconds by using your phone number\u202f \r\n    Save time with an enhanced fuel payment experience\u202f \r\n    Store payment cards securely for convenient access\u202f \r\n    Save fuel receipts automatically by going paperless\u202f \r\n    Find the nearest participating sites using the site locator\u202f \r\n    Enjoy additional fuel savings and convenience store rewards\u202f \r\n\r\nAccess ongoing rewards, special offers, discounts, and more with earnify\u2122, available now at participating bp, Amoco, and ampm sites. \r\n\r\nAre you a bp rewards Visa cardholder? Earn even more and gain access to special offers, gas discounts, and rewards with 30\u00a2 savings on every gallon in the first 60 days after account opening, then 15\u00a2 off per gallon thereafter at bp and Amoco gas stations only, with no annual fee.\u202f \r\n\r\nEarn 5% cashback on your non-fuel purchases at bp and Amoco stations, 3% on groceries and dining, and 1% on all other qualifying purchases! Link your card to the earnify\u2122 app and swipe at the pump to start saving. You can also enjoy the convenience of contactless payments within the app.\u202f \r\n\r\nTerms & conditions apply: https://www.bp.com/en_us/united-states/home/terms-and-conditions.html#tab_credit-cards\u202f",
    "descriptionHTML": "Earn loyalty reward points on every purchase, at the pump and in-store, with earnify\u2122! Newly registered users are eligible for a 250-point welcome offer that can be redeemed for exciting rewards! Please note that points might take up to 24 hours to appear. earnify\u2122 is available at participating bp, Amoco, and ampm sites.\u202f <br><br>With the earnify\u2122  app, you\u2019ll save on app only deals and get rewarded with incredible Bonus Deals on your favorite stuff. <br><br>earnify\u2122 members can enjoy the following perks:\u202f\u202f <br>    Welcome offer of 250 points + 2x points for first 90 days\u202f\u202f <br>    Instant 5\u00a2 savings on every gallon\u202f <br>    Earn 1 point per dollar spent on fuel\u202f <br>    Earn 2 points per dollar spent on convenience\u202f <br>    Redeem for rewards at the pump or on in-store purchases\u202f <br><br>Other earnify\u2122 app features:\u202f <br>    Easily register in just seconds by using your phone number\u202f <br>    Save time with an enhanced fuel payment experience\u202f <br>    Store payment cards securely for convenient access\u202f <br>    Save fuel receipts automatically by going paperless\u202f <br>    Find the nearest participating sites using the site locator\u202f <br>    Enjoy additional fuel savings and convenience store rewards\u202f <br><br>Access ongoing rewards, special offers, discounts, and more with earnify\u2122, available now at participating bp, Amoco, and ampm sites. <br><br>Are you a bp rewards Visa cardholder? Earn even more and gain access to special offers, gas discounts, and rewards with 30\u00a2 savings on every gallon in the first 60 days after account opening, then 15\u00a2 off per gallon thereafter at bp and Amoco gas stations only, with no annual fee.\u202f <br><br>Earn 5% cashback on your non-fuel purchases at bp and Amoco stations, 3% on groceries and dining, and 1% on all other qualifying purchases! Link your card to the earnify\u2122 app and swipe at the pump to start saving. You can also enjoy the convenience of contactless payments within the app.\u202f <br><br>Terms &amp; conditions apply: https://www.bp.com/en_us/united-states/home/terms-and-conditions.html#tab_credit-cards\u202f",
